<p>Indonesian rescuers found the bodies of two Singaporean hikers near the crater rim of Mount Dukono on Halmahera island on Sunday, bringing the confirmed death toll from the eruption to three, local rescue officials said. Rescuers had recovered the body of an Indonesian woman on Saturday after the volcano erupted on Friday, sending a large ash plume into the air. The hikers were part of a group of 20 people on the 1,355-metre volcano. Authorities said 17 survived, including seven Singaporeans and 10 Indonesians. Rescue chief Iwan Ramdani said continuing eruptions, rain and ash around the crater area were slowing the evacuation of the two Singaporeans’ bodies.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Al_Hs1smtDMup-MpC7aAWJ9Re7218WoJUZPaWV42KwZhe4_bmtjg3cGNMRR5p5uHL1pztptY5EFnYgIO8pgpq1CaEaeuYoNTRVNkrhxTy9uL3fLm8jiVJBOPMcrtpOlothvru6DY9SDmpb2r7q11R-OxFruWzVPPCwenHKtluypyROtvmzP_eGX5vRXxsZZoVgD7BBVV1vW4ogj9uhKpv_73EUjkF19yd_P0Q39zVyAGtgGQmsdgdsQ' alt='The volcanic eruption of Mount Dukono in North Halmahera Regency, North Maluku, Indonesia, May 8, 2026, in this screengrab obtained from a social media video.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Search deployment: About 150 personnel and two thermal drones were deployed on Sunday, focusing on an area 100 to 150 metres from the crater rim.</li><li>Crater evidence: Officials said rescuers found backpacks believed to belong to the two Singaporeans; earlier reports said both appeared to be 20 to 30 metres from the main crater rim.</li><li>Search distance: Iwan Ramdani said the ash-covered search area was about 1.25 km from the victims’ last known location.</li></ul><blockquote>This is on drone surveillance and is consistent with witness accounts - Iwan Ramdani</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Singapore Ministry of Foreign Affairs: The ministry said it and Singapore’s embassy in Jakarta were gathering information from Indonesian authorities and providing consular assistance to affected Singaporeans and their families. (<a href='https://www.channelnewsasia.com/singapore/indonesia-volcano-eruption-mount-dukono-singaporean-climbers-mfa-6111121'>Channel NewsAsia</a>)</li><li>Indonesia volcanology agency: The agency maintained the third-highest alert level and said residents and tourists should avoid all activity within 4 km of the crater. (<a href='https://www.cna.com.tw/news/aopl/202605100053.aspx'>Central News Agency</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/southeast-asia/article/3353022/mount-dukono-eruptions-rain-stall-search-2-singaporeans-missing-indonesia'>Indonesia finds bodies of 2 Singaporeans killed in Mount Dukono eruption</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/rescuers-find-1-body-after-volcano-eruption-in-indonesia-as-search-continues-for-2-more'>Rescuers find 1 body after volcano eruption in Indonesia as search continues for 2 more</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/indonesian-rescuers-find-1-body-after-volcano-eruption-132806767'>Indonesian rescuers find 1 body after volcano eruption as search continues for 2 more</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/5/9/missing-singaporeans-located-near-mt-dukono-crater-rim'>Missing Singaporeans Located Near Mt. Dukono Crater Rim</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/may/09/indonesia-volcano-mount-dukono-search-bodies-recovered'>Indonesian rescuers retrieve body from Mount Dukono as search continues</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://energynews.oedigital.com/environment/2026/05/09/two-missing-singaporeans-found-after-mount-dukono-eruption-one-indonesian-is-dead'>Two missing Singaporeans found after Mount Dukono eruption; one Indonesian is dead</a> - oedigital.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/business/environment/search-two-singaporeans-mount-dukono-hampered-by-eruptions-rain-2026-05-10/'>Two Singaporeans confirmed dead in I